nt_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341127005:1":{"text":"我最喜欢喝花果茶。铐兰最常喝的是红茶加牛奶和一块方糖，我的父母口味比较老派，更喜欢不加奶和糖的纯红茶。","source_cn":"我最喜欢喝花果茶。铐兰最常喝的是红茶加牛奶和一块方糖，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4F33C2783DD4F5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1341127006:1":{"text":"一转眼这么多年过去，虽然我还记得茶杯上腾起的水蒸气，装着精致蛋糕的三层托盘和家人的笑声……","source_cn":"一转眼这么多年过去，虽然我还记得茶杯上腾起的水蒸气，装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14F55E4B2710D6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1341127007:1":{"text":"但很可惜，我已经不记得茶的滋味了。","source_cn":"但很可惜，我已经不记得茶的滋味了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD930CCD2B394B60C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1341127008:1":{"text":"卡列琳娜，你可以现在喝上一大口花果茶，找回茶的味道呀！","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，你可以现在喝上一大口花果茶，找回茶的味道呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC574B0D9B562AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1341127008":{"text":"卡列琳娜，你可以现在喝上一大口花果茶，找回茶的味道呀！","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，你可以现在喝上一大口花果茶，找回茶的味道呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC574B0D9B562AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document